WEBVTT


00:00:41.421 --> 00:00:42.914
I'm leaving now.


00:00:42.921 --> 00:00:44.921
What's with all the leftovers
today? Is the food today bad?


00:00:44.956 --> 00:00:46.921
No. I'm just on a diet


00:00:47.421 --> 00:00:49.914
On a diet? That's fifty
five dollars please?


00:00:51.421 --> 00:00:56.000
Don't lose too much weight,
or the wind will blow you away.


00:00:56.035 --> 00:00:58.914
Right. As if!


00:00:58.921 --> 00:01:00.914
- Thanks a lot. See ya
- Bye.


00:01:17.921 --> 00:01:19.914
Haven't seen you in a year.
Yet you still have an apetite.


00:01:24.021 --> 00:01:25.021
Well I'm full now.


00:01:25.921 --> 00:01:26.921
It was very satisfying


00:01:28.921 --> 00:01:30.914
It makes you feel alive.


00:01:38.021 --> 00:01:42.421
Do you think God
will forgive us...


00:01:42.422 --> 00:01:44.914
For what we did in the past?


00:01:44.921 --> 00:01:47.921
Well, it depends which
way you look at it.


00:01:50.921 --> 00:01:53.914
What suddenly made
you think like this?


00:01:56.921 --> 00:02:00.914
You know travelling alone these
few years, boredom I guess!


00:02:00.921 --> 00:02:02.914
It gets me thinking
sometimes...


00:02:14.921 --> 00:02:16.921
Your fried eggs and tomatoes
still taste like crap


00:02:19.921 --> 00:02:23.921
No it doesn't. If it tasted
so bad, why did you finish it?


00:02:23.956 --> 00:02:25.921
You didn't add any soy sauce.


00:02:25.922 --> 00:02:27.921
Who fries eggs with soy sauce?


00:02:27.922 --> 00:02:29.914
Who doesn't fry
eggs with soy sauce?


00:02:29.921 --> 00:02:31.914
Let me fry some up for you!


00:02:31.921 --> 00:02:32.921
I won't eat it.


00:02:32.922 --> 00:02:34.921
Eat it. It's very good.


00:08:56.705 --> 00:08:59.129
Wife


00:09:43.180 --> 00:09:44.713
Excuse me. Excuse me please.


00:09:45.616 --> 00:09:47.581
Attention residents.
Please remain calm.


00:09:49.582 --> 00:09:51.482
In the light of the typhoon
signal number 8 being announced


00:09:51.492 --> 00:09:53.018
All ferry services
have been stopped


00:09:53.069 --> 00:09:55.058
But officer, I have
to go to a banquet.


00:09:55.059 --> 00:09:57.245
So are the boats
still running or not?


00:09:59.246 --> 00:10:01.074
Officer, isn't
that a boat coming?


00:10:01.075 --> 00:10:03.110
That's the last ferry coming
in. Once it docks, it stays.


00:10:03.643 --> 00:10:05.207
Come on!


00:10:05.844 --> 00:10:07.402
Officer Harrison, when will
the ferry services resume?


00:10:08.113 --> 00:10:10.241
Mrs Fong, I'm a policeman, not a
weather man I can't answer that question


00:10:10.248 --> 00:10:12.106
Watch the news, everybody.


00:10:13.077 --> 00:10:15.246
How can we watch the news now?


00:10:15.755 --> 00:10:17.120
I have nowhere to spend the
night, what am I going to do?


00:10:17.423 --> 00:10:19.158
Don't wait here, if you
can go home, go home.


00:10:19.159 --> 00:10:21.039
If you are looking for
a place to stay, go look.


00:10:21.040 --> 00:10:23.007
Alright now, stop
hanging around here.


00:10:23.008 --> 00:10:24.851
I'm in a hurry


00:10:24.852 --> 00:10:26.624
There is nothing
I can do. Go. Go.


00:10:46.130 --> 00:10:47.195
There is still no answer
on Chairman Ma's phone


00:10:48.100 --> 00:10:49.133
Keep trying!


00:11:30.070 --> 00:11:31.268
Did you listen carefully?


00:11:32.273 --> 00:11:35.333
Well, fugitives are
always on the run.


00:11:36.078 --> 00:11:39.740
Last I heard he was nearby


00:11:47.015 --> 00:11:49.648
Mr, is there anything
to eat around here?


00:11:49.700 --> 00:11:52.174
There is a typhoon,
sorry we're closing.


00:11:52.685 --> 00:11:53.545
Thanks.


00:12:09.154 --> 00:12:10.485
Baby, come here!


00:12:11.856 --> 00:12:12.122
Come on, over here!


00:12:13.194 --> 00:12:14.992
Come, baby.


00:12:15.464 --> 00:12:16.489
Come here.


00:12:18.370 --> 00:12:20.036
Come here, baby, come...


00:12:21.174 --> 00:12:23.801
Baby, come, come to mom.


00:12:24.275 --> 00:12:26.367
Baby, come, yeah!


00:12:27.013 --> 00:12:29.404
Yeah... Come here.


00:12:48.016 --> 00:12:49.510
Oh my god. I am so sorry.


00:12:50.185 --> 00:12:51.310
I'll pay you back


00:12:53.154 --> 00:12:54.319
Do you have s
needle and thread?


00:12:55.491 --> 00:12:57.459
Yeah


00:13:03.893 --> 00:13:05.360
Are you here on holiday?


00:13:07.528 --> 00:13:09.496
Aren't you bored,
travelling alone and all?


00:13:12.063 --> 00:13:14.588
I am use to it. Being
alone is convenient.


00:13:15.531 --> 00:13:17.656
Well, we’re stuck with a typhoon
today. Pretty bad timing for a holiday.


00:13:19.633 --> 00:13:23.131
Since I am here, I may
as well enjoy myself.


00:13:31.267 --> 00:13:32.199
I don't mind.


00:13:44.038 --> 00:13:46.472
You know, you can speak
to me in Cantonese.


00:13:47.040 --> 00:13:48.098
Ok.


00:13:58.510 --> 00:14:01.204
Wow, your bag is heavy!


00:14:01.645 --> 00:14:03.339
Did you buy a
lot of souvenirs?


00:14:03.980 --> 00:14:05.947
It's a bowling ball.


00:14:07.284 --> 00:14:09.244
You bought a bowling
ball on your vacation?


00:14:10.622 --> 00:14:11.950
I am a bowling instructor.


00:14:15.160 --> 00:14:17.322
Are restaurants here
open during a typhoon?


00:14:18.196 --> 00:14:20.429
There's one restaurant downstairs
that stays open despite the typhoon


00:14:20.797 --> 00:14:23.864
Just take a left downstairs,
walk down 3 blocks.


00:14:23.865 --> 00:14:25.468
Turn right, take the shortcut
through the bushes and you're there.


00:14:29.036 --> 00:14:32.004
How about this, I
will take you there.


00:14:34.138 --> 00:14:37.374
But lunch is on you.


00:14:37.375 --> 00:14:39.740
Damn it! It's a typhoon 8 and
I'm still stuck here working.


00:14:40.277 --> 00:14:42.301
Ling Ming, since you are sitting so
close why don't you crack up the radio?


00:14:42.302 --> 00:14:44.300
Turn it up! You idiot.


00:14:44.349 --> 00:14:45.778
So nobody's eating! Big deal.
I am still making my noodles


00:14:46.451 --> 00:14:47.477
Winds are expected to pick up in
speed within the next few hours.


00:14:47.500 --> 00:14:50.778
I got nothing to do anyway.
Tell me, what else can I do?


00:14:51.122 --> 00:14:52.783
Good morning, Uncle G.


00:14:53.125 --> 00:14:53.956
Good morning. Hiu Wor.


00:14:54.241 --> 00:14:55.100
Morning. Little Ming


00:14:56.209 --> 00:14:57.098
New boyfriend?


00:14:57.477 --> 00:14:59.301
No. Mr. Bo is here on vacation


00:15:00.546 --> 00:15:02.444
Mr. Bo?


00:15:02.581 --> 00:15:03.243
Mr. Bo...


00:15:03.584 --> 00:15:05.279
Spending some time
for vacation, I see.


00:15:06.419 --> 00:15:08.249
Let me introduce our
specials for today.


00:15:08.921 --> 00:15:10.021
The abalone here
is famous for...


00:15:10.453 --> 00:15:11.252
No thanks. Just
the usual please.


00:15:12.091 --> 00:15:13.149
What's the usual?


00:15:13.660 --> 00:15:14.892
That would be
fish ball noodles.


00:15:15.163 --> 00:15:16.291
Make it fast!


00:15:17.299 --> 00:15:18.664
Have you found a
place to stay yet?


00:15:19.568 --> 00:15:20.562
With the typhoon going on, there won't
be a ferry leaving for a long time.


00:15:21.236 --> 00:15:22.637
I tell you what, I have a place to
rent that you can take up for the night.


00:15:23.008 --> 00:15:26.103
Just four hundred
and fifty dollars


00:15:27.579 --> 00:15:29.580
Think about it.


00:15:33.553 --> 00:15:35.081
Fifty dollars for a bowl of
noodles? Are you trying to rob us?


00:15:36.356 --> 00:15:38.846
The Hong Kong Observatory advises us
to stay indoors during the typhoon.


00:15:39.157 --> 00:15:40.647
I am risking my life here!


00:15:41.193 --> 00:15:43.153
If I get blown away, who's going
to look after my restaurant?


00:15:44.029 --> 00:15:46.426
Fine! Same price for you.


00:15:47.031 --> 00:15:48.298
And I will waive the
10% service charge.


00:15:48.299 --> 00:15:50.602
Damn it! Now I'm losing money.


00:15:52.043 --> 00:15:57.109
You don't look like a bowling
instructor whichever way I look at you.


00:15:57.115 --> 00:15:59.506
Well, you don't look like
a police officer either.


00:16:02.178 --> 00:16:04.306
What are you on about? All female cops
in western films look just like her!


00:16:05.307 --> 00:16:07.770
It was Hiu's childhood dream to become
a police officer. How rightgeous.


00:16:08.281 --> 00:16:10.142
Well, I wouldn't say it
was my childhood dream.


00:16:11.117 --> 00:16:12.607
Certain things just require
people who care to do the job.


00:16:13.352 --> 00:16:17.086
Exactly! Hiu and I are
just those types of people.


00:16:17.121 --> 00:16:19.054
Whatever your complains are, whether it
involves hygiene, transportation or housing.


00:16:20.123 --> 00:16:21.490
Even as small as the discoloration
of toilet paper in public bathrooms.


00:16:22.191 --> 00:16:23.722
The lack of garbage cans or the
lack of tourist information posts.


00:16:23.725 --> 00:16:25.690
Just say a word and I will
have it reported immediately.


00:16:25.700 --> 00:16:27.263
I pay special attention to those
who are weak and less fortunate.


00:16:28.166 --> 00:16:30.199
People like you can't protect
yourself and lack self-righteousness.


00:16:30.203 --> 00:16:32.102
And that's where
Hiu and I come in.


00:16:32.840 --> 00:16:34.105
Come on, we're not the
only ones that can help.


00:16:35.879 --> 00:16:39.403
Defending justice and upholding
society is everyone's responsibility.


00:16:39.450 --> 00:16:41.714
Here, let's eat.


00:16:49.883 --> 00:16:51.815
You need anything else?


00:16:52.217 --> 00:16:53.285
Chopsticks.


00:16:53.300 --> 00:16:54.026
Oh, yes.


00:16:55.027 --> 00:16:57.026
A speedboat in High Island was
overturned by a massive tidal wave.


00:16:57.171 --> 00:16:58.566
Everyone on board is missing.


00:16:59.207 --> 00:17:03.234
The marine police have uncovered a large
quantity of US Dollars on the abandoned vessel.


00:17:04.177 --> 00:17:07.009
Preliminary investigations reveal a possible connection with a
robbery of a money exchange bureau in Tsim Sha Tsui last week.


00:17:07.213 --> 00:17:10.147
Police are investigating three male
suspects of Chinese nationality.


00:17:13.348 --> 00:17:14.576
Eat your noodles.


00:17:19.750 --> 00:17:21.278
This is the police, please
take out your ID cards.


00:17:25.751 --> 00:17:27.249
You want to check my ID
while I am eating noodles?


00:17:27.621 --> 00:17:28.853
Why do you want
to check my ID?


00:17:30.690 --> 00:17:33.216
Excuse me sir, can I please
see some identification?


00:17:34.690 --> 00:17:37.216
Excuse me sir,
can I please see...


00:17:45.391 --> 00:17:47.052
My shoe!


00:21:48.396 --> 00:21:51.224
What the hell?


00:21:51.634 --> 00:21:52.568
Are you alright?


00:22:00.137 --> 00:22:02.964
Can you please do
me one more favor?


00:22:03.001 --> 00:22:04.563
Can you come with me to the
police station to file a statement?


00:22:07.742 --> 00:22:10.067
Little Ming? Where's
my... my restaurant?


00:22:11.542 --> 00:22:13.372
I know it's gone. Why
didn't you mediate?


00:22:14.543 --> 00:22:16.971
I knew you wouldn't


00:22:17.113 --> 00:22:20.308
Ok. Let's go for
a foot massage.


00:22:21.113 --> 00:22:22.908
How about you
massage it for me?


00:22:23.015 --> 00:22:25.210
Don't be shy, come on!


00:22:25.818 --> 00:22:27.710
I don't bite. It's right here.


00:22:49.552 --> 00:22:51.511
Wrong. This "mouth" character is too big.
The character for "mouth" can't be bigger...


00:22:51.690 --> 00:22:53.114
...than the character for "eat" Otherwise you
wouldn't be able to fit the food into your mouth.


00:22:53.258 --> 00:22:55.190
Why would you have
such a big mouth to eat?


00:22:55.228 --> 00:22:57.022
A little mouth is good for
eating. Just write it smaller.


00:22:57.522 --> 00:22:59.914
Smaller.


00:23:00.921 --> 00:23:02.921
Little Kin, have you finished
with your homework yet?


00:23:02.956 --> 00:23:04.598
Your mother is back.
Let’s go home for dinner.


00:23:04.700 --> 00:23:06.000
Ok, ok. Coming.


00:23:06.100 --> 00:23:07.599
- All done!
- Mommy!


00:23:07.921 --> 00:23:08.921
Finish the rest of
it when you get home.


00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:09.921
Did you ask Tarzan for
help with your homework?


00:23:09.956 --> 00:23:11.367
- Yes, it's all done.
- Good boy.


00:23:11.368 --> 00:23:12.701
Here. Vegetables.


00:23:13.205 --> 00:23:14.173
How much?


00:23:14.896 --> 00:23:15.927
Just take it. I will
tell you tomorrow.


00:23:16.365 --> 00:23:17.267
- Thank you!
- Bye!


00:23:17.704 --> 00:23:19.268
Mom. Tarzan bullied me.


00:23:19.540 --> 00:23:22.137
What are you talking
about? Who bullied who?


00:23:28.612 --> 00:23:30.204
Hello?


00:23:31.047 --> 00:23:33.138
Commissioner Yu.


00:23:33.583 --> 00:23:35.641
No problem. Just sign your
name and you can go Mr. Bo


00:23:42.051 --> 00:23:43.118
Thank you. Thank you.


00:23:43.886 --> 00:23:47.920
Attention. Headquarters is
now verifying our suspects.


00:23:48.655 --> 00:23:51.781
There is a 90% chance we caught the guys
involved in the Tsim Sha Tsui robbery last week.


00:23:52.390 --> 00:23:53.623
Good work. You smart girl.


00:23:53.861 --> 00:23:55.157
I've been on the police force for 10
years and I've never cracked a big case.


00:23:55.597 --> 00:23:57.689
You've been at it for 2 years and
already you've solved a major case.


00:23:57.700 --> 00:23:59.769
No, it was all Mr. Bo. I
couldn't have done it without him.


00:24:00.207 --> 00:24:02.170
Just call me Bo.


00:24:02.511 --> 00:24:04.347
One against three. You've
been eating "night congee".


00:24:06.084 --> 00:24:06.915
Is that a midnight snack?


00:24:07.921 --> 00:24:09.921
It's strange that
you've been travelling...


00:24:09.922 --> 00:24:10.100
Well...


00:24:10.153 --> 00:24:12.918
Let me introduce
myself. I am Guan Gong.


00:24:13.289 --> 00:24:16.524
I represent the Outlying Islands district.
Thank you for helping us solve our case.


00:24:17.126 --> 00:24:18.890
I will be nominating you for
the "Good Citizen's" Award


00:24:19.031 --> 00:24:21.358
Well, I can't fight kung-fu, but I do know
one or two things about making kung-fu tea.


00:24:22.067 --> 00:24:24.025
Come. Let's all have some
tea to celebrate. Come.


00:24:25.536 --> 00:24:27.468
Where's the head?


00:24:30.671 --> 00:24:32.733
Can anyone recognise the
person who killed Chairman Ma?


00:24:36.772 --> 00:24:38.930
There are four of you! Four pairs of eyes!
And nobody caught a glimpse of his face?


00:24:39.443 --> 00:24:41.036
He was very quick!


00:24:41.279 --> 00:24:42.077
Very quick?


00:24:42.250 --> 00:24:43.250
Were you drunk?


00:24:43.300 --> 00:24:45.244
He was carrying a bag!


00:24:45.322 --> 00:24:47.889
What kind of bag?


00:24:55.362 --> 00:24:58.626
What kind? What colour was it?


00:25:15.362 --> 00:25:16.362
Hello?


00:25:16.464 --> 00:25:19.459
Boss. Something has
happened to Chairman Ma.


00:25:20.102 --> 00:25:23.165
They took his head


00:25:27.137 --> 00:25:30.595
Find his head. We have to
preserve his whole body!


00:25:31.173 --> 00:25:32.163
Yes, Boss!


00:25:39.108 --> 00:25:43.190
Keep a few people her to watch
Chairman Ma. The others, follow me.


00:25:44.290 --> 00:25:48.320
No matter what. We must
find Chairman Ma's head.


00:25:48.360 --> 00:25:51.522
Let's go. Wake up!


00:25:55.263 --> 00:25:57.654
Come and taste
my Kung-Fu Tea.


00:26:00.299 --> 00:26:01.099
Here. This is yours.


00:26:02.235 --> 00:26:03.133
Here you go. Kiddo.


00:26:03.403 --> 00:26:04.268
Thanks.


00:26:04.904 --> 00:26:07.631
Cheers everybody.


00:26:08.673 --> 00:26:09.662
Thank you.


00:26:15.140 --> 00:26:17.829
There are loads more convicts here. Why
aren't you taking them all if you're all that?


00:26:18.142 --> 00:26:19.233
Wanted: Timothy Ma.


00:26:20.921 --> 00:26:22.914
Mr good citizen.


00:26:23.143 --> 00:26:25.309
How Long have you
been in Hong Kong?


00:26:25.377 --> 00:26:26.673
Two days


00:26:27.378 --> 00:26:28.606
What is your business
on this island?


00:26:28.700 --> 00:26:29.780
I'm on vacation


00:26:29.822 --> 00:26:30.914
Where are you staying?


00:26:31.126 --> 00:26:31.920
I just checked out


00:26:31.921 --> 00:26:33.921
I already asked.


00:26:35.327 --> 00:26:37.117
Do you know how to write
"death" in traditional chinese?


00:26:37.629 --> 00:26:38.419
Tarzan.


00:26:38.629 --> 00:26:42.419
There is no difference with "death"
in traditional or simplified chinese.


00:26:44.138 --> 00:26:47.230
Cathing criminals is for those who've
undergone professional training.


00:26:48.079 --> 00:26:50.603
A bit of Kung Fu is not
gonna to take you anywhere.


00:26:50.751 --> 00:26:54.075
What? You think you're
a cat with nine lives?


00:26:55.153 --> 00:26:56.679
Are we clear?


00:26:56.754 --> 00:26:59.718
The police officer cannot
hear you. I said, are we clear?


00:27:00.593 --> 00:27:02.523
I can't hear you. Speak up!


00:27:02.664 --> 00:27:04.758
Tarzan! What the
hell is your problem?


00:27:05.032 --> 00:27:07.097
Did you pop the
wrong pills today?


00:27:07.103 --> 00:27:08.335
No, Hiu.


00:27:08.443 --> 00:27:11.207
This type of guy, these
brutes. They're bullies.


00:27:11.482 --> 00:27:12.379
They misuse their strength.


00:27:12.785 --> 00:27:14.886
They are dangerous.
Keep your distance, Ok?


00:27:15.057 --> 00:27:17.651
And also, if there's
anything out of the ordinary.


00:27:17.686 --> 00:27:18.787
Speak up!


00:27:19.521 --> 00:27:20.780
Get ready for dinner!


00:27:21.122 --> 00:27:21.616
OK.


00:27:22.257 --> 00:27:24.051
Maggie, could you please add another
place and cook two extra bowls of rice


00:27:25.124 --> 00:27:26.022
I made the rice already.


00:27:26.092 --> 00:27:27.750
Come on, please. Guan
Gong and I will help you.


00:27:27.986 --> 00:27:28.417
I don't have time.


00:27:30.121 --> 00:27:32.618
Here, take my seat. We
will be eating very shortly.


00:27:35.156 --> 00:27:36.146
Waste of breath.


00:27:43.108 --> 00:27:45.116
You're really pathetic. I
won't even let anyone sit down.


00:27:45.198 --> 00:27:47.558
And you let them push you
around. You're terrible.


00:28:04.498 --> 00:28:05.863
Sir, there are no
more rooms to rent.


00:28:06.069 --> 00:28:06.769
Sit down!


00:28:15.921 --> 00:28:17.914
No, Boss.


00:28:32.105 --> 00:28:34.239
You guys go look that way,
we'll go this way. Let's go.


00:29:04.274 --> 00:29:06.667
He's like the plague.
Even the light is broken.


00:29:19.176 --> 00:29:23.141
Stop checking yourself out! You'll never
be as good looking as me. Now move over


00:29:24.013 --> 00:29:24.976
Fix the light.


00:29:25.181 --> 00:29:26.580
Call the electrician
to come and fix it.


00:29:27.049 --> 00:29:29.916
You're crazy, I
can fix it myself.


00:29:30.586 --> 00:29:31.687
Be careful!


00:29:32.191 --> 00:29:33.381
Move over, watch this!


00:29:39.026 --> 00:29:41.258
Wow! That was one strong kick.


00:29:51.295 --> 00:29:53.229
Are you alright?


00:29:53.630 --> 00:29:55.659
Arrest him! He's
attacking the police!


00:30:03.065 --> 00:30:04.227
Hey! What are you doing?


00:30:05.867 --> 00:30:06.765
I feel much better,
all of a sudden.


00:31:17.038 --> 00:31:18.103
What? Something wrong?


00:31:21.574 --> 00:31:22.634
Not bad!


00:31:23.643 --> 00:31:24.775
Come on, it's dinner time.


00:32:09.012 --> 00:32:11.204
You look violent
even when you eat?


00:32:11.326 --> 00:32:13.584
Hey kid! Just because
you don't want yours.


00:32:13.939 --> 00:32:15.828
Doesn't mean you should
give him mine as well.


00:32:16.107 --> 00:32:18.396
It's alright! I'll just ask
Maggie to cook more food.


00:32:19.059 --> 00:32:19.856
Maggie left!


00:33:33.032 --> 00:33:34.230
Are you messing with me?


00:33:36.097 --> 00:33:37.426
Is the taste too plain?


00:33:37.921 --> 00:33:39.921
No. It's very good.


00:33:43.104 --> 00:33:45.471
It's been a long time since I've
eaten such spicy and tasty vegetables.


00:33:47.112 --> 00:33:49.411
Can't you eat spicy food?


00:33:50.018 --> 00:33:52.451
Who says I can't?


00:33:56.086 --> 00:33:58.447
If you can't take
it, spit it out!


00:34:04.056 --> 00:34:05.045
I'm full! I'm full!


00:34:11.051 --> 00:34:13.428
So, how was your first
meal at the jailhouse?


00:34:16.171 --> 00:34:18.135
Very satisfying!


00:34:18.384 --> 00:34:20.442
Well, eating it
once is enough!


00:34:20.986 --> 00:34:22.647
As for those three thieves, they'll
be eating it for a long time to come!


00:34:23.122 --> 00:34:25.655
As for you, kiddo.
Lucky Bo was there.


00:34:26.292 --> 00:34:28.854
Next time something like this happen
again, you must report it to me immediately.


00:34:29.395 --> 00:34:31.162
It was very dangerous.


00:34:31.196 --> 00:34:33.124
I am a police officer,
why would I be scared?


00:34:33.501 --> 00:34:35.501
That's exactly what I feared. That
you are not afraid of anything!


00:34:35.600 --> 00:34:37.378
If only you had gone with your mother
to Canada, everything would've been fine.


00:34:37.379 --> 00:34:38.000
But no, you had to
become a police officer.


00:34:38.019 --> 00:34:40.481
She has a family of her own. I
don't want to get on their way.


00:34:41.212 --> 00:34:43.510
I was born and bred here,
I mean, I speak Chinese.


00:34:44.314 --> 00:34:45.814
This is my home.
Why should I leave?


00:34:45.849 --> 00:34:47.315
What about you?
Where's your home?


00:34:47.921 --> 00:34:48.914
Yeah.


00:34:50.489 --> 00:34:52.483
I come from the grasslands


00:34:52.691 --> 00:34:54.884
I don't have anymore family.


00:34:56.693 --> 00:34:58.861
Oh, I know, you must be...


00:35:00.162 --> 00:35:02.023
One of those guys who
rides his horse everywhere


00:35:02.131 --> 00:35:03.996
Kind of like a shepherd right?


00:35:04.167 --> 00:35:06.658
Something like that.


00:35:08.041 --> 00:35:11.875
Actually, we're just like
you. We're orphans too.


00:35:12.210 --> 00:35:14.775
But orphans plus
orphan equal family.


00:35:15.014 --> 00:35:15.938
Yes.


00:35:16.251 --> 00:35:18.684
Eat, it's very good.


00:35:18.786 --> 00:35:20.376
Look Uncle G. Let's
cut the nonsense


00:35:21.162 --> 00:35:22.829
Just find me a place that
is cheap, nice and spacious.


00:35:23.196 --> 00:35:25.661
Alright! I'll be
waiting for your reply.


00:35:25.731 --> 00:35:27.498
I'll find you a place
to live very soon.


00:35:27.557 --> 00:35:29.821
Here, drink some tea.


00:35:30.134 --> 00:35:32.492
Don't worry, I won't
charge you a commission.


00:35:33.135 --> 00:35:37.067
Happy birthday to you!


00:35:38.071 --> 00:35:42.231
Happy birthday to you!


00:35:42.507 --> 00:35:46.387
Happy birthday to Hiu!


00:35:46.422 --> 00:35:50.268
Happy birthday to you!


00:35:50.379 --> 00:35:51.346
Happy birthday!


00:35:52.480 --> 00:35:53.779
Thank you!


00:35:54.384 --> 00:35:55.680
I chose this cake myself.


00:35:55.886 --> 00:35:56.846
Make a wish about me okay?


00:35:57.261 --> 00:35:58.691
Whatever.


00:36:02.297 --> 00:36:04.461
Good!


00:36:14.099 --> 00:36:16.500
Sorry you had to do
the dishes with me.


00:36:17.039 --> 00:36:19.664
Well, I had a part in eating,
so I have a part in cleaning.


00:36:20.275 --> 00:36:21.470
You got that right!


00:36:24.144 --> 00:36:28.603
Oh, by the way, thank you for
cooperating with the police.


00:36:38.146 --> 00:36:40.106
Do you have to be so cool?


00:36:40.215 --> 00:36:44.411
You're cuter when you eat.


00:36:55.118 --> 00:36:58.642
You almost died back there.
Weren't you even a little scared?


00:36:59.187 --> 00:37:00.000
Yeah!


00:37:00.024 --> 00:37:02.558
But, as a cop, you
have to face your fears.


00:37:03.026 --> 00:37:04.289
It's our responsibility.


00:37:13.130 --> 00:37:16.493
Hey! What's that?


00:37:18.103 --> 00:37:20.431
A wolf's tooth.


00:37:21.106 --> 00:37:23.431
You like wolves?


00:37:23.543 --> 00:37:26.407
I respect them.


00:37:27.046 --> 00:37:29.473
They are the guardian
spirits of the plains.


00:37:30.015 --> 00:37:32.446
We normally believe
that when we die...


00:37:33.016 --> 00:37:35.444
The wolf can guide
our spirit to heaven.


00:37:37.053 --> 00:37:39.482
What, so you worried
about going to hell?


00:37:42.663 --> 00:37:44.691
Maybe!


00:37:44.798 --> 00:37:46.696
Come on, you're
definitely going to heaven.


00:37:47.007 --> 00:37:49.637
You're a good person.


00:37:51.074 --> 00:37:53.301
Thanks.


00:37:55.077 --> 00:37:59.610
You know, I have a more
practical guardian angel.


00:38:02.019 --> 00:38:03.486
You.


00:38:13.023 --> 00:38:14.615
Why don't I teach you
how to protect yourself?


00:38:17.093 --> 00:38:18.691
Are you kidding? I should
teach you few more moves or two.


00:39:36.695 --> 00:39:37.691
What are you doing?


00:39:38.180 --> 00:39:39.440
I'll arrest you for
police harassment.


00:39:39.517 --> 00:39:41.575
I should arrest you first!


00:39:43.086 --> 00:39:45.054
When you're done
with your cake, leave.


00:39:45.125 --> 00:39:47.487
This is a police station or
did you think it was a resort?


00:39:49.028 --> 00:39:51.488
Let's go and file a complaint.


00:39:52.037 --> 00:39:53.401
Come on, let's go!


00:39:54.037 --> 00:39:55.401
Where?


00:39:56.056 --> 00:39:56.602
Next to Tien Hiu Temple Road.


00:39:56.650 --> 00:39:57.902
Mrs. Robinson again?


00:39:57.903 --> 00:39:58.902
Who else?


00:40:00.903 --> 00:40:01.902
What were you doing with him?


00:40:01.905 --> 00:40:03.902
Nothing, none
of your business!


00:40:08.077 --> 00:40:10.144
Thanks for helping
out Uncle G.


00:40:10.345 --> 00:40:11.469
Lunch is on me.


00:40:12.025 --> 00:40:13.592
Alright, bye!


00:40:13.666 --> 00:40:14.926
Bo, alright. Come here...


00:40:16.468 --> 00:40:18.704
I found you two places.
Both are in Tung Wan


00:40:19.105 --> 00:40:22.672
Both are two hundred and fifty. One
has a TV, the other one doesn't...


00:40:24.176 --> 00:40:25.402
Thanks!


00:40:43.077 --> 00:40:45.005
Stop! Stop! Stop!


00:40:45.061 --> 00:40:46.459
Give it to me!


00:40:47.083 --> 00:40:49.477
Why did you grab my bag?


00:40:52.084 --> 00:40:54.145
Why are you running away?


00:40:54.158 --> 00:40:55.490
I am going home!


00:40:58.161 --> 00:41:01.787
Hiu, did you like the
birthday gift I gave you?


00:41:02.183 --> 00:41:04.447
Yes, thanks, but next time
don't waste your money.


00:41:04.519 --> 00:41:07.118
It's not a waste, as
long as you liked it.


00:41:07.119 --> 00:41:09.649
So did you like it?


00:41:23.289 --> 00:41:24.816
Hey!


00:41:29.127 --> 00:41:31.661
So, what's the matter Mrs. Robinson?
Who's disturbing you tonight?


00:41:32.040 --> 00:41:35.764
Those dogs over there! They have
been barking all night. I can't sleep!


00:41:36.141 --> 00:41:37.799
Go and poison them for me!


00:41:38.079 --> 00:41:40.707
Mrs. Robinson, calm down
now! We'll take care of it.


00:41:41.154 --> 00:41:43.100
You'll take care of it...


00:41:43.122 --> 00:41:45.716
You better take care of
it or else I'll report you!


00:41:52.190 --> 00:41:54.881
So damn troublesome.


00:41:54.927 --> 00:41:56.989
Dogs are animals, they
bark, what does she expect?


00:41:57.035 --> 00:41:59.031
They only bark when
there are strangers.


00:41:59.136 --> 00:42:03.704
Hiu, did you see
the present yet?


00:42:49.104 --> 00:42:51.693
What's the matter with
you? What's going on?


00:43:02.139 --> 00:43:05.706
What are all of you
doing here together?


00:43:06.007 --> 00:43:07.767
We are just avoiding
the rain officer.


00:43:08.108 --> 00:43:09.769
What's on the ground?


00:43:12.077 --> 00:43:14.607
Stand over there!


00:43:14.712 --> 00:43:16.045
I said stand over there!


00:43:16.047 --> 00:43:18.507
Stand right there!


00:43:37.148 --> 00:43:39.740
Don't move!


00:44:35.016 --> 00:44:36.511
Boss!


00:44:36.651 --> 00:44:38.878
Have you found
Chairman Ma's head yet?


00:44:39.087 --> 00:44:42.981
Not yet but
Jellyfish is onto him.


00:44:43.000 --> 00:44:45.000
You must find
Chairman Ma's head.


00:44:45.023 --> 00:44:47.685
I know, Boss!


00:44:48.091 --> 00:44:49.200
But...


00:44:49.293 --> 00:44:51.691
Chairman Ma is now
inside the police station.


00:44:52.095 --> 00:44:53.685
What?


00:44:54.063 --> 00:44:56.755
They found Chairman Ma's body
and brought it to the station.


00:44:58.064 --> 00:45:01.662
You idiot! Chairman Ma cannot stay
over night at the police station!


00:45:01.799 --> 00:45:03.627
You have to get him out.


00:46:12.601 --> 00:46:14.259
Put the bag down.


00:46:47.005 --> 00:46:50.000
Seriously Harrison, we have been brothers for over
ten years now. You have to believe me on this one.


00:46:50.075 --> 00:46:52.000
I really saw Bo.


00:46:52.076 --> 00:46:54.766
Who beat you guys up?


00:46:55.078 --> 00:46:57.672
Hiu, did you see Bo?


00:46:57.713 --> 00:46:59.673
No.


00:47:00.000 --> 00:47:01.850
Guan Gong.


00:47:01.885 --> 00:47:02.846
This case definitely
involves Bo!


00:47:02.953 --> 00:47:03.621
Why?


00:47:04.190 --> 00:47:06.423
When I was on site,
I saw Bo's shadow.


00:47:06.498 --> 00:47:08.629
You saw Bo's shadow?


00:47:09.167 --> 00:47:11.000
No, seriously.


00:47:11.035 --> 00:47:13.135
Think of it. The two of
us beat up three guys.


00:47:13.170 --> 00:47:15.535
So who beat up these two? Who has
the best Kung-Fu on the island...


00:47:16.073 --> 00:47:18.631
And who else would
come back to save her?


00:47:19.010 --> 00:47:21.646
You see, he
couldn't has known.


00:47:23.047 --> 00:47:25.611
Where to go to save her.


00:47:26.049 --> 00:47:28.646
Unless he knew there
was something going on.


00:47:29.051 --> 00:47:31.681
But he couldn't has known
what was going on there.


00:47:32.619 --> 00:47:34.482
Unless he had
something to do with it.


00:47:36.090 --> 00:47:37.691
I agree.


00:47:38.093 --> 00:47:39.957
Where's the proof?


00:47:40.000 --> 00:47:41.223
I want to file a report...


00:47:41.437 --> 00:47:42.835
What's the problem?


00:47:42.986 --> 00:47:43.916
Madam, I have been beaten...


00:47:44.098 --> 00:47:46.257
Calm down and speak slowly.


00:47:46.800 --> 00:47:48.460
What's the problem...


00:47:48.596 --> 00:47:50.459
One at a time.
What's the issue?


00:47:54.098 --> 00:47:55.565
Let him go!


00:47:56.035 --> 00:47:57.111
Don't mess with me, I just
want to take this body away.


00:47:57.437 --> 00:47:58.532
Hold your fire, it's gasoline!


00:47:59.005 --> 00:48:00.631
Don't move! Don't move!


00:48:01.008 --> 00:48:02.442
Stay calm!


00:48:03.095 --> 00:48:04.492
Let's go!


00:48:07.170 --> 00:48:08.465
Open the lock! Hurry up!


00:48:10.173 --> 00:48:11.436
Hurry up!


00:48:15.175 --> 00:48:17.505
Where's the body?


00:48:22.044 --> 00:48:24.536
Hey! Come help!


00:49:12.015 --> 00:49:13.475
Hold your fire, it's gasoline!


00:49:56.121 --> 00:49:58.783
Don't move! Get down!


00:49:58.818 --> 00:50:01.446
Get down... don't move!


00:50:01.524 --> 00:50:02.692
Officer Harrison!


00:50:14.195 --> 00:50:15.619
Tarzan. Are you OK?


00:50:18.063 --> 00:50:19.494
I'm fine


00:50:23.168 --> 00:50:25.462
You're all OK, right?


00:50:40.070 --> 00:50:42.332
No, we're fine.


00:50:46.071 --> 00:50:47.198
What's wrong?


00:50:48.006 --> 00:50:50.331
Do I look bad?


00:50:51.075 --> 00:50:54.400
You look great!


00:51:06.047 --> 00:51:08.412
You were brave as ever today.


00:51:36.150 --> 00:51:38.474
Special report. Typhoon Bo is
steering away from Hong Kong.


00:51:39.188 --> 00:51:41.486
The Hong Kong Observatory has
lowered the signal to a signal 3.


00:51:42.188 --> 00:51:44.486
All transportations will resume
their normal operations shortly.


00:52:01.033 --> 00:52:03.696
Morning Sir!


00:52:03.770 --> 00:52:04.635
Is everyone here?


00:52:04.713 --> 00:52:05.607
Everyone is here, Sir!


00:52:05.615 --> 00:52:06.049
Let's go!


00:52:06.385 --> 00:52:07.980
Yes, Sir!


00:52:50.087 --> 00:52:53.321
At this point, nobody's happy.


00:52:54.089 --> 00:52:55.317
Including myself


00:52:55.457 --> 00:52:57.457
Now, what we need to do is...


00:52:57.500 --> 00:52:59.500
Bring this
murderer to justice.


00:52:59.564 --> 00:53:01.689
Our source tell us that...


00:53:02.174 --> 00:53:04.673
This case involves an
international drug ring.


00:53:11.178 --> 00:53:13.079
The deceased is Timothy Ma,
also known as Chairman Ma.


00:53:13.114 --> 00:53:16.446
He is the crime syndicate mastermind, and
is wanted by international authorities.


00:53:17.019 --> 00:53:20.545
Right now, his body is intact
and his head is missing.


00:53:22.195 --> 00:53:25.456
Which means the murderer could be on the
run with his head and still on this island.


00:53:27.031 --> 00:53:32.520
Involved in this case is another person.
Who is managing Timothy Ma's death?


00:53:33.139 --> 00:53:34.602
I have reason to
believe that...


00:53:36.010 --> 00:53:38.439
The gang who came to the police station to
steal his body is linked to Chairman Ma's wife.


00:53:39.014 --> 00:53:41.481
Special report. A suspected murderer
was uncovered in the Outlying Islands.


00:53:41.550 --> 00:53:43.683
Two officers were injured
during the incident.


00:53:43.752 --> 00:53:45.413
One hour later, an attack occurred
at the local police station


00:53:45.888 --> 00:53:47.624
One officer was killed.


00:53:48.163 --> 00:53:50.494
The marine police are on their way to the
crime scene to assist further investigation.


00:53:50.888 --> 00:53:51.887
You over there!


00:54:09.888 --> 00:54:11.887
Police! Stop!


00:54:17.888 --> 00:54:20.100
Dispatch, suspect found.
Black shirt, black trousers...


00:54:25.888 --> 00:54:27.100
Timothy Ma's wife


00:54:27.888 --> 00:54:29.100
Miho Sasaki


00:54:29.888 --> 00:54:33.100
While Timothy Ma was on the
run over the last 6 months.


00:54:33.888 --> 00:54:35.100
She took control of
the crime syndicate.


00:54:35.188 --> 00:54:37.100
Unfortunately, we have no
evidence against this woman.


00:54:37.188 --> 00:54:39.100
Because her record
is cleaner than yours.


00:54:53.888 --> 00:54:54.100
ID card.


00:54:56.888 --> 00:54:58.100
Hurry up.


00:55:03.103 --> 00:55:05.571
What's inside this bag?
Open it, let me take a look.


00:55:06.888 --> 00:55:08.100
Where do you live?


00:55:08.101 --> 00:55:10.100
I live in Kowloon.


00:55:11.101 --> 00:55:12.100
What are you doing here?


00:55:12.101 --> 00:55:13.100
Just visiting friends.


00:55:14.101 --> 00:55:15.500
OK


00:55:15.501 --> 00:55:17.100
So did you bring it or not?


00:55:18.005 --> 00:55:22.638
We need to handle this now. Hurry
up and find Timothy Ma's murderer.


00:55:22.888 --> 00:55:24.100
Prevent any and
all confrontation.


00:55:26.107 --> 00:55:27.235
Sir!


00:55:28.144 --> 00:55:30.477
I suspect someone.


00:55:35.149 --> 00:55:36.740
Attention all units...


00:55:37.185 --> 00:55:39.646
We have a suspect, male...


00:55:39.888 --> 00:55:41.100
30's, medium build...


00:55:41.101 --> 00:55:43.100
Short dark brown hair, wearing army
green jacket and black trousers.


00:55:43.888 --> 00:55:45.100
Speaks fluent Putonghua.


00:55:47.058 --> 00:55:49.682
You in the green jacket...
stay right there! Don't move!


00:55:50.093 --> 00:55:52.817
Don't move! Now,
put down your bag!


00:55:53.157 --> 00:55:55.027
Do you hear me?


00:55:55.028 --> 00:55:57.552
Put down the bag, faster!


00:55:59.557 --> 00:56:01.487
Both hands on your head.


00:56:03.157 --> 00:56:05.487
Don't move!


00:56:06.157 --> 00:56:08.487
- Let's go. Let's go.
- Yes sir!


00:56:29.133 --> 00:56:31.658
Are you in a hurry to leave?


00:56:33.070 --> 00:56:34.633
The boat is here.


00:56:36.106 --> 00:56:38.405
Bo Tong Lam.


00:56:43.074 --> 00:56:47.566
If you did not break the law, you
will definitely catch this ferry.


00:56:48.078 --> 00:56:49.438
Open the bag.


00:56:52.049 --> 00:56:53.414
I said, open the bag.


00:57:00.085 --> 00:57:01.318
Don't move!


00:57:10.154 --> 00:57:12.355
Kid


00:58:13.157 --> 00:58:15.487
Let's go


00:58:17.093 --> 00:58:17.853
Bo!


00:58:28.095 --> 00:58:30.427
Last night,
officer Harrison...


00:58:33.033 --> 00:58:34.465
My condolences.


00:58:43.067 --> 00:58:45.426
Can you answer a
question for me?


00:58:49.050 --> 00:58:52.678
Last night, the person who saved
me at Tin Hau Temple Road...


00:58:53.087 --> 00:58:55.485
Was that you?


00:59:00.064 --> 00:59:00.491
No.


00:59:09.064 --> 00:59:11.491
Goodbye!


00:59:12.069 --> 00:59:14.466
Can I borrow your phone?


00:59:27.071 --> 00:59:28.530
Call me.


00:59:33.073 --> 00:59:35.201
Ok.


00:59:38.073 --> 00:59:39.201
- Bye.
- Bye.


00:59:43.073 --> 00:59:45.201
- Bye.
- Bye.


01:00:30.073 --> 01:00:31.201
Hello?


01:00:31.373 --> 01:00:32.201
Fat Wing.


01:00:32.373 --> 01:00:33.201
Boss.


01:00:33.373 --> 01:00:35.501
- Where is he?
- I'm watching him.


01:00:35.573 --> 01:00:37.901
- Don't let him escape.
- He won't escape.


01:00:38.373 --> 01:00:40.201
How much longer before
the boat arrives?


01:00:41.273 --> 01:00:43.201
Did you hear me?
How much longer?


01:00:44.073 --> 01:00:46.201
Fat Wing.


01:00:47.073 --> 01:00:49.201
Fat Wing, say something!


01:00:49.273 --> 01:00:51.201
I asked you how much longer?


01:00:51.273 --> 01:00:54.201
About half an hour.


01:00:57.073 --> 01:00:59.201
I want you to return
my husband's head.


01:00:59.373 --> 01:01:03.201
I'll give you one day
to leave Hong Kong.


01:01:24.373 --> 01:01:28.201
You haven't slept all
night, are you tired?


01:01:31.373 --> 01:01:33.201
Do you think you'll
be alive tomorrow?


01:01:35.373 --> 01:01:38.201
I ask myself the same
question everyday, tomorrow...


01:01:38.373 --> 01:01:40.201
Will I still be alive?


01:01:52.373 --> 01:01:54.201
Don't worry.


01:01:55.373 --> 01:01:58.201
Everything will
come to an end soon.


01:02:46.373 --> 01:02:47.201
Fat Wing.


01:02:48.373 --> 01:02:50.201
Help, help!


01:02:50.373 --> 01:02:52.201
I'm in here!


01:02:52.373 --> 01:02:54.201
Help him out.


01:02:56.373 --> 01:02:58.201
No need to help me.


01:02:58.273 --> 01:03:00.201
Hurry up, get the guy in the
green jacket with the bag.


01:03:00.373 --> 01:03:02.901
Hurry up! Hurry!


01:03:38.073 --> 01:03:39.201
Hello.


01:03:39.373 --> 01:03:40.901
Hey kid.


01:03:41.073 --> 01:03:44.201
Our colleagues have
discovered Timothy Ma's killer.


01:03:45.073 --> 01:03:47.201
Hey, you there?


01:03:48.073 --> 01:03:49.201
Who is it?


01:03:49.373 --> 01:03:51.201
We suspect it's Bo.


01:03:51.373 --> 01:03:54.201
Officers found Timothy Ma's
head inside a bowling ball.


01:03:54.373 --> 01:03:56.201
He just escaped.


01:03:57.373 --> 01:03:59.201
Commissioner Yu wants you back
in the station immediately.


01:04:01.003 --> 01:04:02.201
Drive.


01:04:21.373 --> 01:04:23.201
Please lend me your phone.


01:04:49.373 --> 01:04:51.201
How was your vacation?


01:04:56.373 --> 01:04:58.201
Pretty good.


01:04:58.373 --> 01:05:02.000
I heard a birthday
song and made a wish.


01:05:04.373 --> 01:05:07.000
It's a holiday,
you should be happy.


01:05:21.373 --> 01:05:23.000
Bo.


01:05:37.373 --> 01:05:39.000
Hiu Wor.


01:06:11.373 --> 01:06:15.201
I'm sorry, I'm keeping you from
returning to the Police Station.


01:06:15.373 --> 01:06:19.201
With all the bad you've done, it's
only a matter of time before we get you!


01:06:20.373 --> 01:06:23.201
Will you arrest your friend?


01:06:23.373 --> 01:06:27.201
He killed Chairman Ma.
Will you arrest him?


01:06:27.373 --> 01:06:30.201
I will arrest anyone,
who broken the law!


01:06:59.373 --> 01:07:03.201
Your friend is here, shall I
allow you to arrest him first?


01:07:04.373 --> 01:07:06.201
How many do think
he can take on?


01:07:06.373 --> 01:07:08.201
Fifty or a hundred?


01:10:01.073 --> 01:10:03.201
Bo!


01:10:11.073 --> 01:10:13.201
Quick! Get up! Bo!


01:10:18.073 --> 01:10:20.201
Quick! Get up! Bo!


01:12:08.073 --> 01:12:10.201
Bo, Run!


01:13:17.073 --> 01:13:19.038
Bo! Get up!


01:13:19.073 --> 01:13:22.201
Hurry, get up! Bo!


01:13:31.073 --> 01:13:33.201
Bo!


01:14:03.073 --> 01:14:07.201
Let me show you how it
feels to be beheaded!


01:15:03.073 --> 01:15:05.201
Bo!


01:15:10.073 --> 01:15:12.201
Bo!


01:15:30.073 --> 01:15:31.201
Yesterday...


01:15:34.073 --> 01:15:39.137
my life's...


01:15:39.172 --> 01:15:44.201
happiest day.


01:15:46.073 --> 01:15:52.201
It was also my birthday.


01:17:31.073 --> 01:17:34.201
Eventually, he left.


01:17:35.073 --> 01:17:39.201
Just like the typhoon,
leaving nothing behind.


01:17:41.073 --> 01:17:45.201
Nobody knows why he
took Chairman Ma's head.


01:17:45.373 --> 01:17:48.201
Some say it's a native custom.


01:17:49.073 --> 01:17:53.201
Until one day, I
discovered a news story.


01:17:53.373 --> 01:17:55.201
One year ago, a nurse from
a volunteer organisation


01:17:55.373 --> 01:18:02.201
Was abducted by drug dealers, whilst treating
a patient along the Thai-Burma border.


01:18:02.373 --> 01:18:06.201
chairman Ma took her hostage and demanded the local
government to release his party members from jail.


01:18:06.373 --> 01:18:09.201
In the end, the
negotiations fell apart.


01:18:10.373 --> 01:18:13.201
Afterwards, I searched for more old news
articles which were possibly related to him.


01:18:28.073 --> 01:18:33.201
Sorry. This is the only way
I can repay you for saving me.


01:19:08.073 --> 01:19:10.201
Hey there!


01:19:11.073 --> 01:19:13.201
Long time no see.


01:19:13.373 --> 01:19:16.201
I've been busy. I hardly
come this way nowadays.


01:19:17.073 --> 01:19:19.201
Shredded beef, less rice?


01:19:20.073 --> 01:19:22.201
To go please, thanks.


01:19:22.373 --> 01:19:24.201
Shredded beef, less rice.


01:19:25.073 --> 01:19:27.201
Fifty five dollars.


01:19:31.073 --> 01:19:33.201
What's with the leftovers,
does my food taste bad?


01:19:33.373 --> 01:19:35.201
No, I'm just on a diet.


01:19:36.073 --> 01:19:38.201
On a diet?


01:19:38.373 --> 01:19:40.201
It'll be fifty five dollars.


01:19:41.073 --> 01:19:44.201
Don't lose too much weight,
or the wind will blow you away.


01:19:44.373 --> 01:19:45.201
Right, as if!


01:19:45.373 --> 01:19:47.201
OK thanks, bye bye.


01:19:48.373 --> 01:19:52.201
If a person killed someone
who did something terrible...


01:19:52.202 --> 01:19:55.201
can we say that this
person is providing justice?


01:19:55.202 --> 01:19:59.201
Of course not, the law will
decide the fate of the criminal.


01:19:59.203 --> 01:20:03.201
And you don't have the right to
decide the life or death of a person.

